# Source art. WORKSPLIT §4 allows exactly two binaries in the repo - models\ingvar.fbx and
# models\ingvar_albedo.png, the body's build inputs. Everything below is Meshy's raw per-clip
# output: six files, each carrying a duplicate copy of the mesh AND 22 MB of the same textures,
# 343 MB for six views of one dwarf. tools\build_ingvar.py regenerates all of it.
models/ingvar.glb
models/10ktridwarf.glb
models/dwarf_*.glb
models/dwarf_*.fbx
models/ingvar_*.glb
models/ingvar_*.fbx
models/preview/*_[0-9][0-9].png
models/preview/row_*.png
models/preview/nod/nod_[0-9][0-9].png
